e": "vlcsnap-2025-03-14-18h02m52s239.png", "id": "3858292641167430", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473397628_3858292644500763_6631730531060227035_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w5jE28WdcS0Q7kNvwFB1W-E&_nc_oc=AdlRMalfwi1xjOAB1r3giF5YrzaQLP7nqxvVm3oi4sER6LbCxj95PiAUF04Lh5zHJ8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz_XgLPrfIdRY9ZnP6Xi04oaRv8iMjiL61i_clyZNbVJA&oe=69AFFC68"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "4659145680893317", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392329_4659145684226650_3106660382712700741_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W9huUW4-1xkQ7kNvwGt3npZ&_nc_oc=Adms0kwWVgZV1wls2dHcW5myxyp9pS-vWGfwHa_tW_GmYLOp3OdFM3VxMf5IzHOFFSo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afycp4_deZaqedpAo9VrtnB69hktkRdsqwck5akkM56gpg&oe=69B02C55"}, "display_name": "Cat in Town", "keywords": ["cat", "town", "role", "adventure"], "long_description": "Cat in Town is a sandbox action-adventure game with light puzzles and a rich storyline. You play as a cat exploring the town, interacting with the residents, and searching for clues to uncover a heartwarming story that's been hidden for years.\nSpecial Thanks To:\n- The amazing performances of over 10 town residents.\n- Sheriff Stan for his unwavering support and assistance.\n- The anonymous donations of mission items from several townspeople.\n- Dozens of town-approved achievements waiting for you to unlock\u2026\nWe hope you enjoy a magical and touching adventure in the town. Have fun!", "short_description": "Cat in Town is a sandbox action-adventure game, you play as a cat who mysteriously finds itself living in a coastal town, full of vibrant stories just waiting for you to explore and experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy.737.com/protocol/30379-2.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "p